---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn more about Houxue Studio — an independent software development studio."
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">About Us</h1>
    <div class="mt-10 max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        <strong class="text-gray-900">Houxue Studio</strong>
        is an independent software development studio dedicated to creating
        high-quality mobile applications that serve real user needs.
      </p>
      <p>
        The name "Houxue" (厚雪, thick snow) embodies our philosophy — we believe in the
        power of compounding. Small, consistent improvements accumulate over time to
        create exceptional products. Just as snow builds up on a long slope, we focus on
        sustainable, long-term value creation.
      </p>
      <p>
        We are currently focused on the Android platform, building apps that
        are intuitive, reliable, and thoughtfully designed.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
